OL,3,AMaura Higgins to fill Cilla Black's
OL,4,Ashoes as host of Blind Date reboot
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is being revived by Disney+, and on
OL,7,FWednesday the streamer mimicked one of
OL,8,FBlack's old Blind Date catchphrases in
OL,9,Fits announcement on Instagram: "'Blind
OL,10,FDate host, what's your name and where
OL,11,Fd'ya come from?' It's... Maura
OL,12,FHiggins."
